{
  "id": "section-mapping",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mapping\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1380,1388]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Your journey through the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1388,1413]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "nightmare town is mapped in a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1413,1443]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "series of “boxes”. Each box\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1443,1471]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "represents a different location.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1471,1504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you step into a box, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1504,1534]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "number the box (1, 2, 3, etc.) and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1534,1569]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll on a table to generate events\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1569,1604]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and potential opponents for that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1604,1637]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "area. You fight monsters by rolling\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1637,1673]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "dice and taking tactical decisions,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1673,1709]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and keep a tally of the resources\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1709,1743]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you use. Certain locations are safe\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1743,1779]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "areas and give you the opportunity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1779,1814]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to rest and lick your wounds. But\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1814,1848]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "don’t get too comfortable, because\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1848,1883]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mapping:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "no location is safe forever.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,1883,1912]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    5
  ]
}
